

############## IMOVEIS ################

### Listar todas as IMOVEIS
GET http://localhost:3000/imoveis


### Buscar IMOVEIS por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/imoveis/150badaa-ec9b-4e32-9b8a-5a8f52ea44fe


### Criar uma novo IMOVEL
POST http://localhost:3000/imoveis/
Content-Type: application/json

{
   
  "nome": "Residencial Nova Morada - Apto 401",
  "endereco": "Rua das Alamedas, 456"

}




### Atualizar IMOVEL
PATCH http://localhost:3000/imoveis/70595134-afb3-47dd-a43c-6ac2d34eb78c
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
  "nome": "Edifício Central - Bloco A"

}



### Deletar uma IMOVEL
DELETE http://localhost:3000/imoveis/70595134-afb3-47dd-a43c-6ac2d34eb78c







